  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十五关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "快藏起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "我......我必须走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "这个......这个，给你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "这是我们的护身符，是我妈妈亲手教我做的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "给你们的这个是我做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "亲手做的布偶，能保证重要的人平安无事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩们",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，米莎姐姐，我们会好好保管它的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "真乖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "藏好！别出声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩们",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "往哪去了？！你们，追！看那些感染者还能跑多远！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？这里......看来还有些东西呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......依据能天使的情报，任务目标一定在这附近逗留过才对......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啊啊，这里的地形真是很复杂，光凭罗德岛，这个任务果然也有些麻烦呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "幸好联系了企鹅物流......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......有人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "这些人是......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "坏蛋！你们这些坏蛋！放开我！放——开——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说！她往哪跑了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别不知好歹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龙姐姐！龙姐姐！你在哪里！救命啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米莎姐姐！米莎姐姐，救救我！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别想走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......我劝你们，立刻离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪里来的外地人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就不怕我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "否则——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，那是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "法术！她，她在使用法术？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊！别过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——以后别再做些欺压弱小的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃呃啊，怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "呵......怪物......吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "好啦，没事了，都出来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "这里危险，快去安全点的地方吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩们",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢你，兔姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "都小心点啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "阿米娅，这是什么情况？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯，我看见了一个，应该也是未登记的感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "乌萨斯人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "是的，乌萨斯人，她往贫民区更深处去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "芙兰卡，让附近参与搜查的干员集合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Ok。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "越往贫民区前进，形势就越复杂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "一般居民，犯罪分子，未确认身份的流民......层出不穷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "必须多加准备才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "有通信，阿米娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "请稍等一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "阿米娅，是近卫局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "是陈长官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——是的，我们已经搜查出了不少非登记感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——白色短发，乌萨斯人，少年女性，身高一米四五左右，名叫米莎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "这是——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "阿米娅，陈长官要求我们，立即搜查具备这种特征的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "一经发现，立刻交给近卫局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "请给我一下通讯设备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "喂，喂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陈长官，你听得到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我听得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我能否确认下，刚才你下达命令的有效性？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "真实可靠，立刻执行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "突然就挂断了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "陈长官，好硬的脾气啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那这就是我们接下来所要执行的任务了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "阿米娅......几位重装干员向我发来了另一条通讯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "他们遭遇了对罗德岛干员展现出攻击倾向的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "而且，那些袭击者不是普通人，他们是......感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......让重装干员们向我们目前所在的区域撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "侦察小队！去追踪任务目标，白发乌萨斯少女，身高1.45米，务必注意隐蔽和安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "其他干员，跟随各自的队长散开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "以逸待劳，很好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这是......诱敌深入？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "芙兰卡小姐，我们是不是要伏击敌人？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
          "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
          "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
          "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
          "text": "哟——不错嘛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
          "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
          "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
          "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
          "text": "雷蛇，这孩子很聪明呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雷蛇",
          "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
          "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
          "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
          "text": "......Dr.{@nickname}可是战术指挥官，你严肃点。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "行动吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "攻击罗德岛的感染者......吗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
